{"2657960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spada", "steam_appid": 2657960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5056500], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spada</strong> is a gladiator combat game that combines <strong>lightning-fast</strong> reflexes with <strong>rhythm-based button sequences</strong>. Every fight is a brutal test of <strong>precision</strong>, <strong>timing</strong>, and <strong>endurance</strong>, set in an unforgiving arena where mistakes are fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat unfolds through sequences of button prompts that demand accuracy and rhythm. Success means striking in perfect cadence, chaining attacks, and surviving the relentless pace of battle. The rhythm doesn’t come from music—it comes from the flow of combat itself, turning each fight into a deadly performance where timing is everything.<br><br>Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm-Based Combat:</strong> Engage in battles driven by button sequences that require both speed and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes Gameplay:</strong> Armor deteriorates with each hit, health doesn’t regenerate automatically, and every decision matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Economy:</strong> Earn resources in battle and choose whether to heal or upgrade your gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Difficulty:</strong> Opponents grow faster and tougher as you progress, testing both reflexes and rhythm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Arena Atmosphere:</strong> The crowd reacts to your performance, influencing the fight and adding tension to every move.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657960/extras/309f71207646123301550b9b4613f817.poster.avif?t=1787972412\" width=1170 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657960/extras/309f71207646123301550b9b4613f817.webm?t=1787972412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657960/extras/309f71207646123301550b9b4613f817.mp4?t=1787972412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system is unique and based on &quot;time-to-action&quot;: there are eight possible buttons, but only one becomes the active button at any given moment. Each button must be pressed within a short timeframe. If you make a mistake, take a hit...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657960/extras/b4cc326ddb95c012af7ec9e20d37b410.poster.avif?t=1787972412\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657960/extras/b4cc326ddb95c012af7ec9e20d37b410.webm?t=1787972412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657960/extras/b4cc326ddb95c012af7ec9e20d37b410.mp4?t=1787972412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to successfully execute a button sequence; only then will you finally be able to attack the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By landing multiple hits, you will be able to defeat them completely and prepare for the next opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657960/extras/05026b2ff51367e4cd6652f38d9b057c.poster.avif?t=1787972412\" width=1170 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657960/extras/05026b2ff51367e4cd6652f38d9b057c.webm?t=1787972412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657960/extras/05026b2ff51367e4cd6652f38d9b057c.mp4?t=1787972412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character &amp; Status System<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657960/extras/9724b22a54ec21ea1d16eb2548f26262.avif?t=1787972412\" width=1488 height=210 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your gladiator have five equipment slots:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helmet</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chest  Armor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shield</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leg Armor</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item gradually loses integrity when struck, weakening your defenses. Even the sword’s edge dulls over time, reducing its effectiveness as battles progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Health Bar</strong> represents permanent damage: it does not regenerate automatically and can only be restored by spending rewards earned after each fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Crowd Bar </strong>(on sides)<strong> </strong>reflects the audience’s favor. It shifts continuously during combat, and your performance carries over to the next battle. Impress the crowd and you’ll start with momentum on your side; disappoint them and even victory may not guarantee their support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This creates a <strong>snowball effect</strong>: a strong start amplifies your damage, defense, and resources, while a poor performance makes survival increasingly difficult across a run.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spada</strong> is a gladiator combat game that combines <strong>lightning-fast</strong> reflexes with <strong>rhythm-based button sequences</strong>. Every fight is a brutal test of <strong>precision</strong>, <strong>timing</strong>, and <strong>endurance</strong>, set in an unforgiving arena where mistakes are fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat unfolds through sequences of button prompts that demand accuracy and rhythm. Success means striking in perfect cadence, chaining attacks, and surviving the relentless pace of battle. The rhythm doesn’t come from music—it comes from the flow of combat itself, turning each fight into a deadly performance where timing is everything.<br><br>Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm-Based Combat:</strong> Engage in battles driven by button sequences that require both speed and timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes Gameplay:</strong> Armor deteriorates with each hit, health doesn’t regenerate automatically, and every decision matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Economy:</strong> Earn resources in battle and choose whether to heal or upgrade your gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Difficulty:</strong> Opponents grow faster and tougher as you progress, testing both reflexes and rhythm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Arena Atmosphere:</strong> The crowd reacts to your performance, influencing the fight and adding tension to every move.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657960/extras/309f71207646123301550b9b4613f817.poster.avif?t=1787972412\" width=1170 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657960/ext